nresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、假設人稱與未名者保留；游説中扮演梁王不當昭魚本人身份，安陵氏與阿衡不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0174","start":174,"end":177,"surface":"趙襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002525","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002526","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0202","start":202,"end":205,"surface":"魏桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0207","start":207,"end":210,"surface":"韓康子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"知伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002526","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0255","start":255,"end":258,"surface":"魏桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0259","start":259,"end":262,"surface":"韓康子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0263","start":263,"end":266,"surface":"韓康子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0267","start":267,"end":270,"surface":"魏桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0279","start":279,"end":281,"surface":"知氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、假設人稱與未名者保留；游説中扮演梁王不當昭魚本人身份，安陵氏與阿衡不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0303","start":303,"end":305,"surface":"知氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、假設人稱與未名者保留；游説中扮演梁王不當昭魚本人身份，安陵氏與阿衡不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0333","start":333,"end":334,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002579","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m058-0342","start":342,"end":344,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002579","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p059","text":"齊、楚相約而攻魏，魏使人求救於秦，冠蓋相望也，而秦救不至。魏人有唐雎者，年九十餘矣，謂魏王曰：『老臣請西説秦王，令兵先臣出。』魏王再拜，遂約車而遣之。唐雎到，入見秦王。秦王曰：『丈人芒然乃遠至此，甚苦矣！夫魏之來求救數矣，寡人知魏之急已。』唐雎對曰：『大王已知魏之急而救不發者，臣竊以爲用策之臣无任矣。夫魏，一萬乘之國也，然所以西面而事秦，稱東藩，受冠帶，祠春秋者，以秦之彊足以爲與也。今齊、楚之兵已合於魏郊矣，而秦救不發，亦將賴其未急也。使之大急，彼且割地而約從，王尚何救焉？必待其急而救之，是失一東藩之魏而彊二敵之齊、楚，則王何利焉？』於是秦昭王遽爲發兵救魏。魏氏復定。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"唐雎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002607","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002601","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002579","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002601","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"唐雎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002607","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002579","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002579","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"唐雎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002607","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002579","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m059-0143","start":1